  <item>
    <title>S2Vol3 从工科到文科：P人读博真的不做规划么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6681962d077b88831b4bc6a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6681962d077b88831b4bc6a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Jun 2024 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>球球：厦门大学广告学博士研究生，工学硕士。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> 交叉学科的普遍应用给跨学科读博提供了基础</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> P人更多的是一种“随遇而安”的心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1164">19:24</a> 工科和文科对学术思维和写作训练的差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 读博就像Gap了四年，在找自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 有时候规划越明确，就越容易焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> 大家对“女博士”的刻板印象是因为个体的性格差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3246">54:06</a> 今天在读博士的“集体”状态除了压力和焦虑，也有“自由”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2217">36:57</a> P是一种人生态度，J是在每一个小的问题上做的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Paper Planes —— The Best Thing</span></p><span></span><p><span>Yutaka Hirasaka —— Eau</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目互动】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@小智_走不停</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：小智说给你听</span></p>]]></description>
