    <title>S1Vol3 创业｜灵魂拷问：我适合创业么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61402e78536b84fffb6d3c5a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61402e78536b84fffb6d3c5a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Sep 2021 05:09:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>订阅【远焦日志-小智】带你一起远离生活的焦虑！</span></p><span></span><p><span>每期播客详细内容可以在公众号【小智说给你听】里查看，欢迎私信。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“天时、地利、人和”是创业的必要条件，“向死而生”是创业者的常态。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主要话题】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> 带着“北京情结”实习、读书、工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> 我的电台节目被狱警当作劳改素材</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> “大众创业，万众创新”的浪潮下我找了个副业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 告别话筒，我就这样辞职了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="977">16:17</a> 最怀念的创业时期：公司像“家”一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 我活得像“程序员”一样“向死而生”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> 创业者要放下“傲慢与偏见”，热爱并坚持下去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> “主要是成为伟大，而非显得伟大。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【相关声音】</span></p><span></span><p><span>版头声音素材：取自厦门环岛南路101号驾校训练场</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期背景音乐：It Was May 柯智棠</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>新浪微博：小智_走不停</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：小智说给你听</span></p>]]></description>
